  "notes": "Previewed with o3-mini on 2024-12-20 in the Day 12 livestream of 12 Days of OpenAI and released with o4-mini on 2025-04-16. The 2026-06-11 deprecation names the snapshot o3-2025-04-16, the only snapshot listed on the docs page, with shutdown scheduled for 2026-12-11; retired is left empty until then. The docs say o3 is succeeded by GPT-5. The bare alias o3 is candidate because it also occurs in o3-mini and o3-pro contexts and outside AI. OpenAI's post Early access for safety testing (https://openai.com/index/early-access-for-safety-testing/, 2024-12-20) opened applications to test its next frontier models but does not name o3, so it is not cited."
